[9.4723, "o", "\u001b[H\n\u001b[38;2;37;50;74;1mKeyboard help\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\nGlobal\u001b[K\r\n  ?            open or close this help\r\n  Esc          close an overlay or return to the parent screen\u001b[K\r\n  q / Ctrl-C   quit\r\n\u001b[K\nNavigation\u001b[K\r\n  \u2191/\u2193 or j/k   scroll timeline text; move rows in lists\u001b[K\r\n  [ / ]        jump to previous/next timeline event\r\n  Home/End     jump to the first or last row\u001b[K\r\n  g/G          jump to the first or last row\r\n  PgUp/PgDn    scroll long evidence\u001b[K\r\n  n/p          next/previous session or search page\r\n  Enter        open a session or expand/collapse a timeline card\u001b[K\r\n  Target       footer names the event Enter, d and u act on\r\n  Esc          return to the previous reading context, including search\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\nActions\u001b[K\r\n  d            inspect selected normalized event\r\n  w            toggle wrapping in inspection; \u2190/\u2192 pan when unwrapped\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;2;37;50;74;1m[FOCUS] Help \u00b7 returns to Timeline\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[24;13H\u001b[38;2;102;112;133mPgUp/PgDn \u00b7 g/G ends \u00b7 Esc close \u00b7 ? close\u001b[m\u001b[K"]
